Package: vabaxos-dictation
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.12), gir1.2-adw-1, whisper.cpp, pipewire-bin, pulseaudio-utils, coreutils
Recommends: vabaxos-settings
Description: Dictation without Internet: speak, and the text is written
 Super+H, as in Windows: a tone, you speak, Super+H again, and the text is
 written where the cursor is, in any program, then said aloud. The speech
 is recognized on the computer by whisper.cpp with the multilingual
 Whisper "small" model (MIT): nothing goes on the Internet. Punctuation
 comes by itself; "a capo" makes a new line. Silence is never sent to the
 model, and the sentences Whisper invents on noise are removed.
 .
 Live captions too, Super+Ctrl+L as in Windows: the words of what the
 computer plays (a video, a call) or of the microphone, in large letters,
 a few seconds after they are said, for people who hear little.
